---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { IMG } from '../lib/assets';
---
<Base title="For Vendors | Colorado Elopement Guide" description="Colorado wedding vendors: your listing is free forever. Claim it, add photos and packages, and reach couples planning elopements. Featured placement $40/month, first month $1.">
  <section class="relative min-h-[38vh] flex items-end">
    <img src={`${IMG}/vendors-cta.jpg`} alt="Florist arranging a bridal bouquet" class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover" fetchpriority="high" />
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-ink/80 via-ink/25 to-black/25"></div>
    <div class="relative z-10 max-w-7xl mx-auto px-5 md:px-8 pb-12 w-full">
      <p class="eyebrow text-gold mb-3">For Colorado Wedding Vendors</p>
      <h1 class="display text-white text-4xl md:text-5xl leading-tight">Couples are planning here.<br /><span class="serif-i">Meet them.</span></h1>
    </div>
  </section>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-5 md:px-8">
    <section class="pt-12">
      <p class="text-ink/70 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">Colorado Elopement Guide is where couples planning elopements and micro weddings browse vendors by region, save favorites to a planner, and reach out directly. If you work small weddings in Colorado, you're likely already listed.</p>
      <div class="mt-8 rounded-3xl border border-hairline bg-parchment/60 p-7 md:p-9 grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-7">
        <div>
          <p class="display text-xl mb-2">1 · <span class="serif-i">Sourced</span></p>
          <p class="text-sm text-ink/70 leading-relaxed">Every listing starts from public business data and Google ratings. Never pay to exist.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="display text-xl mb-2">2 · <span class="serif-i">Claimed</span></p>
          <p class="text-sm text-ink/70 leading-relaxed">Claim free to correct details, add photos and packages, and get monthly reports of real, bot filtered clicks and inquiries.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="display text-xl mb-2">3 · <span class="serif-i">Labeled</span></p>
          <p class="text-sm text-ink/70 leading-relaxed">Featured placement is paid and always labeled. Ratings are Google's. We never write or alter reviews.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="pt-12">
      <h2 class="display text-3xl leading-tight">Simple, honest <span class="serif-i">pricing</span></h2>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-5 mt-8">
        <div class="rounded-3xl border border-hairline bg-white p-8">
          <p class="eyebrow text-ink/50 mb-2">Listed</p>
          <p class="display text-4xl">$0<span class="text-lg text-ink/40"> / forever</span></p>
          <ul class="mt-6 space-y-3 text-sm text-ink/75">
            <li>✓ Full listing with your details, ratings and links</li>
            <li>✓ Claim it to edit anytime</li>
            <li>✓ Monthly click &amp; inquiry counts</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
            <a href="/vendor-dashboard" class="inline-block rounded-full border border-ink px-6 py-3 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-ink hover:text-ivory transition-colors">Create Vendor Account</a>
            <a href="/vendor-dashboard" class="inline-block rounded-full px-6 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-ink/60 underline underline-offset-4">Vendor Sign In</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-3xl border-2 border-clay-500 bg-white p-8 relative">
          <span class="absolute -top-3.5 left-8 eyebrow bg-clay-500 text-ivory rounded-full px-4 py-1.5">First Month $1</span>
          <p class="eyebrow text-clay-600 mb-2">Featured</p>
          <p class="display text-4xl">$40<span class="text-lg text-ink/40"> / month</span></p>
          <ul class="mt-6 space-y-3 text-sm text-ink/75">
            <li>✓ Top of your category and region pages, labeled "Featured"</li>
            <li>✓ Homepage rotation</li>
            <li>✓ Photo gallery + packages on your listing</li>
            <li>✓ Annual option: 12 months for the price of 10</li>
            <li>✓ Cancel anytime, no contract</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-5 text-xs text-ink/45">For comparison: premium placement on the big national wedding platforms reportedly runs $200 to $1,200 per month.</p>
          <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
            <a href="/claim" class="inline-block rounded-full bg-clay-500 text-ivory px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold hover:bg-clay-600 transition-colors">Start With Your Free Listing</a>
            <a href="https://buy.stripe.com/7sYaEZffj1AaaWr93A9oc02" rel="noopener" class="inline-block rounded-full border border-clay-500 text-clay-700 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold hover:bg-clay-50 transition-colors">Go Featured Now →</a>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-3 text-xs text-ink/50">Use code <strong>FIRSTMONTH1</strong> at checkout for the $1 first month.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="text-xs text-ink/40 mt-8 pb-4">Featured placement is always labeled. Placement never changes the Google ratings shown, and we never write or alter reviews.</p>
    </section>
  </div>
</Base>
